OL,3,AChina denies allegations of spy
OL,4,Aoperation targeting Nvidia CEO
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe report said Alice Huang, who is of
OL,7,Fno relation to Jensen Huang, was under
OL,8,Finvestigation over the possible
OL,9,Fdiversion of advanced Nvidia AI chips
OL,10,Fto China and had developed a close
OL,11,Frelationship with Jensen.
OL,13,FNvidia said their interactions were
OL,14,Froutine business engagements, while
OL,15,FBeijing accused Washington of
OL,16,Fattempting to smear China. Alice Huang
OL,17,Fdid not respond to the paper's request
OL,18,Ffor comment.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
